  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組是為《鬼滅之刃》模組新增動畫的附加模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>（《鬼滅之刃》模組）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/demonslayer\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/demonslayer</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>[所需模組]</p>\n<p>您也需要下載&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obfuscate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obfuscate</a> </span>模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組使用 MCreator 開發</p>\n<p>MCreator&rarr;<span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcreator.net/</a></span></p>",
